OL,3,GNEWSAHow long could you manage on #3 of
OL,4,Afood a day?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sandwich shop is challenging people
OL,7,Fto survive on just #3 of food a day to
OL,8,Fhighlight the growing number of people
OL,9,Ffacing food insecurity.
OL,11,FEat Social, which operates a cafe in
OL,12,FWensum Street, Norwich, is launching
OL,13,Fthe campaign in October, asking people
OL,14,Fto sign up to take part in the two-day
OL,15,Ftask.
OL,17,FIt comes as the latest figures from the
OL,18,FFood Foundation show one in six
OL,19,Ffamilies with children are facing food
OL,20,Finsecurity.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
