OL,3,GNEWSAHow long could you manage on #3 of
OL,4,Afood a day?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLisa Vincent, who set up the community
OL,7,Finterest company after hearing stories
OL,8,Fof children presenting with diseases
OL,9,Fcaused by malnutrition, said the
OL,10,Fsituation was "unacceptable" and she
OL,11,Fwanted the challenge to raise
OL,12,Fawareness.
